Package: essurvey2
Title: Download Data from the European Social Survey API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("David", "Macro", , "david@dataim.nl", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: A client for the European Social Survey (ESS) data API at
    <https://api.ess.sikt.no>. Data files are discovered through the ESS
    metadata catalogue and downloaded as Apache Parquet, then returned as
    'data.table' objects. Rounds, countries, themes, data files and
    variables can all be listed before any survey data is transferred.
    This package targets the API that replaced the web download endpoints
    used by the earlier 'essurvey' package, which no longer work.
